<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-BETIS REJECT MAN UNITED OFFER FOR RIOS-PAPER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BETIS REJECT MAN UNITED OFFER FOR RIOS-PAPER.</headline>
<dateline>SEVILLE, Spain 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real Betis have rejected an offer of 1.5 billion pesetas ($10.5 million) for international defender Roberto Rios by Manchester United, the Spanish sports daily Marca said on Friday.</p>
<p>United manager Alex Ferguson has travelled to Spain several times this season to watch Rios play.</p>
